Package: ct
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: encrypted text editor
 ct is a desktop text editor with built-in AES-128-GCM encryption.
 It stores text as a hex string in the form nonce/ciphertext/mac and
 can also hide encrypted text in PNG images.
 .
 This package contains the GUI application and the ct_nox command
 line tool.
